9b31-d5c6f2a21a45", "city": "", "name": "Ahmad Hassan", "email": "", "notes": "", "phone": "+92 345 3700004", "source": "", "status": "Demo Completed", "company": "", "callLogs": [{"id": "81e324aa-b845-4aab-8a15-ab87318a9173", "date": "2026-05-01T12:04:00.000Z", "notes": "Now regarding product setup:\nWe handle:\n•\tBrand entry \n•\tUnit entry \n•\tProduct categories \nWe create:\n•\tCategories \n•\tSubcategories \n•\tMulti-level category structure (up to 3 levels) \nHowever, if you prefer, you can also manage these yourself according to your business needs.\nFor example:\n•\tYou might not only use watts as units \n•\tYou may have packets, pieces, boxes, etc. \n•\tYou can define custom units for each product \nYou can also:\n•\tAssign units to products \n•\tDefine warranty categories (e.g., product warranty duration) \n\nVendor & Customer Management\n•\tYou can add vendors (suppliers) \n•\tYou can add customers \n•\tSystem supports both types \n•\tYou can manage warranties and relationships \n\nUser Roles & Permissions\nIf you have multiple users:\n•\tYou can assign roles \n•\tExample: one user only sees accounts \n•\tAnother user cannot access sales/purchase \n•\tPermissions can be fully controlled \n\nPurchase & Inventory Flow\n1.\tYou create a Purchase Order \n2.\tSend it to vendor \n3.\tWhen goods are received → system auto-updates stock \n4.\tNo need for manual re-entry \n\nSales Flow\n•\tYou create a Quotation (Draft) \n•\tIf approved → converts into Proforma Invoice \n•\tPartial payments can be recorded \n•\tAfter completion → Final Invoice generated \nInvoices show:\n•\tAdvance payments \n•\tRemaining balance \n•\tTimeline \n\nInventory Adjustment\nSometimes stock doesn’t match:\nExample:\n•\tYou purchased 1500 items \n•\tSold 700 \n•\tBut only 600 are left physically \n→ 200 items missing\nPossible reasons:\n•\tManual sales \n•\tLoss/damage \nSystem allows:\n•\tStock adjustment \n•\tSeparate adjustment for loss \n•\tAudit tracking \nIf confirmed sale:\n•\tCreate a “walk-in customer” invoice \n•\tStock and payment both get balanced \n\nProject Management\nSome products require full execution (like solar installations):\n•\tAssign projects to teams \n•\tTrack daily progress \n•\tMonitor completion status \nBusiness Settings\nSystem includes:\n•\tBusiness settings \n•\tCRM settings \n•\tInvoice customization \n•\tDashboard customization \nYou can:\n•\tHide/show dashboard items \n•\tRearrange layout \n•\tCustomize invoices \n\nHe will visit the office on 8th May approx ( have to follow up on 8th) \nOffered rough estimate of 90k to 1 lac for the whole software and for the Whatsapp automation offered 30k approx but not final as he is busy and will make the final decision after coming back from Dubai", "outcome": "Answered", "createdAt": "2026-05-03T11:16:31.641Z"}, {"id": "21408a04-60c5-43f8-aeed-7a0d2660c97a", "date": "2026-05-01T12:21:00.000Z", "notes": "Detail talk about req and meeting scheduled on 8th May", "outcome": "Answered", "duration": "40 mint", "createdAt": "2026-05-01T12:22:15.246Z"}, {"id": "5b4a684f-cf46-425b-ba2a-5dd82aba133f", "date": "2026-05-01T10:18:00.000Z", "notes": "Msg sent", "outcome": "No Answer", "createdAt": "2026-05-01T10:19:02.139Z"}], "industry": "", "createdAt": "2026-04-14T08:44:07.922Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-03T11:16:31.642Z", "assignedTo": "Sumbleen Javaid", "isRelevant": true}, {"id": "68130fdc-7028-427f-8840-96fd7dc03657", "city": "", "name": "Wasiuddin", "email": "", "notes": "", "phone": "+92 336 3779580", "source": "", "status": "Contacted", "company": "", "callLogs": [{"id": "cb401335-f848-4195-a952-c7fcc67c0b99", "date": "2026-05-01T10:16:00.000Z", "notes": "Msg sent", "outcome": "No Answer", "createdAt": "2026-05-01T10:17:13.842Z"}], "industry": "", "createdAt": "2026-04-14T08:44:21.900Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-01T10:17:13.843Z", "assignedTo": "Sumbleen Javaid", "isRelevant": true}, {"id": "b6b1379b-1bf6-4994-804a-861d982f7d2c", "city": "", "name": "A", "email": "", "notes": "", 