-8728-43d2-bdb2-0c9a4d2f2797", "city": "", "name": "Ali Shah", "email": "", "notes": "", "phone": "+92 316 4828719", "source": "", "status": "Demo Completed", "company": "", "callLogs": [{"id": "a843a936-cf7c-4747-88b5-44327f06e64a", "date": "2026-05-05T13:23:00.000Z", "notes": "Meeting on WhatsApp\n1. Requirements:\n\nEk centralized portal/dashboard\nShopify integration for order fetching\nOrders ki complete details show hon:\nQuantity\nAmount\nCustomer name\nAddress\nPhone number\nProduct listing + product sync (website ↔ software)\nOrder status system:\nConfirm → session / processing\nCancel → cancellation section\nPending → pending section\nDispatch system (handled by head office)\nCourier integration (API-based):\nMultiple courier companies\nTracking system auto-fetch\n\n2. Technical Points:\n\nAPIs required for:\nShopify\nMultiple courier companies\nReal-time sync + tracking system\n\n3. Price or days:\nOffered 90k to 1 lac and will take 8 to 10 days in completion\n\n4. Key Takeaway:\n\nClient wants a fully integrated order management system\nFocus on syncing, and tracking from Shopify and\nMulti-courier support is important requirement", "outcome": "Answered", "duration": "5 min", "createdAt": "2026-05-05T13:33:19.990Z"}, {"id": "2074ff2e-8d81-4622-bdb1-562ddfda577a", "date": "2026-05-05T10:11:00.000Z", "notes": "Humein chahiye ke jo orders humein Shopify pe aate hain woh hamare ek dashboard par show hon. Aur sara data jo order karta hai like date, naam, amount, aur aage address etc ye sab nazar aaye.\n\nUs ke baad har order ke aage hamare paas options hon: “New”, “Authorised”, “Confirm”, “Dispatch”, “Cancel”, “Pending”, “Add Processing”, theek hai?\n\nAur jab hum dispatch karein to woh aage tamam courier companies ke saath link ho jaye.\n\nBaqi humein monthly reporting bhi chahiye: total orders, monthly total sales, total orders, returns kitne ho rahe hain, pending kitne hain, dispatch kitne hain etc ye sab tafseelat mil jayein gi.\n\nMeeting at 6pm", "outco