m codes, units, categories)\nOpening stock entry for raw materials\nSupplier/vendor database\nPurchase requisition system\nPurchase Order (PO) creation & approval workflow\nGoods Receipt Note (GRN)\nRM quality check (optional)\nRM stock ledger (in/out balance)\n2. Procurement & Vendor Management\nVendor ledger accounts\nVendor payment tracking\nPurchase invoices & billing\nCredit terms handling\nVendor-wise reports\n3. Production / Contractor Management\nBill of Materials (BOM) for finished goods\nContractor (thekedar) database\nContractor ledger (advance, payments, balances)\nJob work / contract assignment\nProduction tracking (RM issued vs FG received)\nWastage / scrap tracking\n4. Finished Goods (FG) Inventory\nFinished goods master\nOpening stock for FG\nFG stock management (batch-wise if needed)\nStock transfer between locations (if applicable)\nInventory valuation\n5. Sales & Invoicing\nCustomer database\nSales order management\nSales invoicing\nCustomer ledger\nReceivables tracking\nCredit limits & payment terms\n6. Logistics & Supply Chain\nDispatch planning\nDelivery tracking\nTransporter database\nLogistics ledger (freight, expenses)\nDelivery challan / shipment documentation\n7. Accounting & Finance\nGeneral ledger (GL)\nChart of accounts\nAutomated journal entries (from purchases, sales, etc.)\nCash & bank management\nExpense tracking\nProfit & loss statement\nBalance sheet\nTrial balance\n8. Reporting & Dashboards\nStock reports (RM & FG)\nSales reports\nPurchase reports\nContractor/job work reports\nFinancial reports\nCustom dashboards (real-time insights)\n9. User Management & Controls\nMulti-user roles & permissions\nAudit trail (who did what)\nData security", "outcome": "Answered", "duration": "15 min", "createdAt": "2026-05-03T15:03:46.255Z"}], "industry": "", "createdAt": "2026-05-03T15:02:51.776Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-03T15:03:46.255Z", "assignedTo": "Sumbleen Javaid", "isRelevant": true}, {"id": "e31697ef-16f2-446e-bea2-425e62f31c11", "city": 