Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T19:51:17.938Z", "assignedTo": "Sumbleen Javaid", "isRelevant": true}, {"id": "6f7ed2af-9ecc-4468-b593-50760b34027a", "city": "", "name": "Rahman", "email": "", "notes": "", "phone": "+92 345 4653972", "source": "", "status": "Contacted", "company": "", "callLogs": [{"id": "133911ba-4375-4281-beb8-af4ff1583944", "date": "2026-05-06T19:52:00.000Z", "notes": "Req:\nProfit Bill wise\nProfit customer wise \nProfit item wise \nand WhatsApp integration ( told 80k for this whole customization)\nNo reply after that yet", "outcome": "Answered", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T19:53:40.270Z"}], "industry": "", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T19:52:27.813Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T19:53:40.270Z", "assignedTo": "Sumbleen Javaid", "isRelevant": true}, {"id": "e5fa8386-5a5f-44e9-9ec3-a217b9fe6af2", "city": "", "name": "Farhan", "email": "", "notes": "", "phone": "+92 321 6457829", "source": "", "status": "Contacted", "company": "", "callLogs": [{"id": "8be229cc-aa7a-4b84-838a-7c4a76411fc7", "date": "2026-05-06T19:54:00.000Z", "notes": "Asked for demo (Demo sent no reply after that)", "outcome": "Answered", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T19:55:38.335Z"}], "industry": "Graphics ", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T19:54:51.902Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T19:55:38.335Z", "assignedTo": "Sumbleen Javaid", "isRelevant": true}, {"id": "65dc5525-f45d-458c-b5dd-d92daf43dc6d", "city": "", "name": "Engr Javed khan Marwat", "email": "", "notes": "", "phone": "+92 300 5300145", "source": "", "status": "Contacted", "company": "", "callLogs": [{"id": "767d4e8b-7fd0-4adc-9cf9-45b8b1c31bf9", "date": "2026-05-06T19:57:00.000Z", "notes": "Asked the cost", "outcome": "Answered", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T19:57:25.060Z"}], "industry": "", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T19:57:05.652Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T19:57:25.061Z", "assignedTo": "Sumbleen Javaid", "isRelevant": true}, {"id": "914ec9fa-bedd-40db-bf2f-2f80d0c52f52", "city": "", "name": "Taimoor Safdar", "email": "", "notes": "", "phone": "+92 303 5166225", "source": "", "status": "Contacted", "company": "", "callLogs": [{"id": "ae21c411-ae1b-4fec-944b-711c843af2a0", "date": "2026-05-06T19:59:00.000Z", "notes": "He said he will contact later\n\nOffered 2 types :\n\nCustom software in 250K PKR. \nComplete custom development. (Tech Stack is Laravel, Node.js or Python)\n\nReady made ecommercer store upto 50K PKR (Laravel Tech Stack)\n\nReady made system link:\nhttps://demo.activeitzone.com/ecommerce/login?_ga=2.212193108.1304149677.1675238184-1713902016.1668489048&_gl=1*1tuqy7p*_ga*MTcxMzkwMjAxNi4xNjY4NDg5MDQ4*_ga_X1XGT943P9*MTY3NTMxMTM5My4xNC4xLjE2NzUzMTM2NzkuMC4wLjA.\n\nWebsite\nhttps://demo.activeitzone.com/ecommerce/?_ga=2.212193108.1304149677.1675238184-1713902016.1668489048&_gl=1*1tuqy7p*_ga*MTcxMzkwMjAxNi4xNjY4NDg5MDQ4*_ga_X1XGT943P9*MTY3NTMxMTM5My4xNC4xLjE2NzUzMTM2NzkuMC4wLjA.", "outcome": "Answered", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T20:03:37.881Z"}, {"id": "ed6b21f1-ab66-47e9-86ee-98223ddfa3b6", "date": "2026-05-06T19:59:00.000Z", "notes": "Requirements: \nMulti-Tenant E-Commerce Platform — Development Specification\n1. Overview\nThis project is a multi-tenant e-commerce platform where users can create and manage their own online stores.\nEach user:\nCreates their own store\nGets access to a separate admin dashboard\nManages products, orders, UI components, and store settings\nConnects their own backend services (database, file storage, etc.)\nThe system is not subscription-based. It is intended to be free to use, with a focus on flexibility, performance, and scalability.\n2. Architecture Overview\n2.1 High-Level Structure\nThere will be two separate applications:\nAdmin Dashboard (Control Panel)\nURL pattern: admin.example.com\nUsed by store owners\nStorefront (Customer-Facing Website)\nURL pattern:\nDefault: storename.com or storename.pk\nCustom domain supported\n2.2 Multi-Tenant Model\nEach user (tenant) manages their own store independently\nPlatform stores:\nDatabase connection string (e.g., Neon DB)\nFile upload service credentials (e.g., UploadThing)\nEach tenant:\nUses their own database\nUses their own storage configuration\nThe main platform acts as:\nAuthentication layer\nTenant manager\nRouter for domains and stores\n3. User Flow\n3.1 Onboarding\nUser visits platform\nChooses:\nLogin OR\n\"Start as Admin\"\nFirst-time setup:\nStore name\nAdmin credentials\nDatabase connection string (Neon DB)\nUpload service configuration (UploadThing or similar)\nOptional: custom domain\n3.2 Store Initialization\nAfter setup:\nStore is provisioned\nDashboard becomes available\nStorefront is live (default template)\n4. Admin Dashboard Features\n4.1 Core Modules\nProducts\nCreate, edit, delete products\nProduct fields:\nName\nPrice\nDescription\nImages\nCategory\nStock (optional)\nCategories\nCreate nested categories\nAssign products\nOrders\nView orders\nUpdate order status\nBasic order tracking\nBanners\nCreate promotional banners\nAssign to sections (home, category, etc.)\n4.2 UI Customization System (Important)\nThis is a key differentiator.\nApproach:\nNOT drag-and-drop\nComponent-based customization\nFeatures:\nUsers can:\nSelect predefined UI components (e.g., product card, cart view)\nModify properties such as:\nBackground color\nText color\nBorder radius\nLayout variations\nPreview changes in real-time\nExample Components:\nProduct Card\nProduct Grid\nCart Component\nHeader / Navbar\nFooter\nBanner Sections\nBehavior:\nComponents are configurable via structured properties (JSON-based or similar)\nChanges are applied instantly to storefront\n4.3 Theme System\nGlobal theme settings:\nPrimary color\nSecondary color\nTypography (optional)\nAffects entire storefront consistently\n4.4 Domain Management\nSupport:\nDefault subdomain (storename.example.com)\nCustom domain (user-provided)\nDomain mapping handled at platform level\n5. Storefront (Customer-Facing)\n5.1 Core Features\nHomepage\nProduct listing pages\nProduct detail pages\nCart\nCheckout (basic)\nResponsive design\n5.2 Behavior\nReads configuration from tenant setup\nUses:\nTenant’s database\nTenant’s UI configuration\nShould feel like a standard modern e-commerce site\n6. Platform Backend Responsibilities\n6.1 Central Platform Database\nStores:\nUsers (admins)\nTenant configurations:\nDatabase URL\nUpload service credentials\nDomain info\n6.2 Responsibilities\nAuthentication\nTenant routing\nDomain resolution\nStore initialization\n7. Performance & Scalability Requirements\n7.1 Performance\nFast page load (SSR or optimized rendering preferred)\nMinimal client-side overhead\nEfficient API calls\n7.2 Scalability\nShould support many tenants\nIsolation between tenants is required\nNo shared data leakage\n8. Technical Expectations\n8.1 Code Structure\nClean modular architecture\nClear separation:\nDashboard\nStorefront\nCore platform logic\n8.2 Suggested Stack (Flexible)\nFrontend: React / Next.js (preferred)\nBackend: Node.js\nDatabase: Tenant-provided (Neon DB)\nStorage: Tenant-provided (UploadThing or similar)\n9. Important Constraints\nNo subscription system\nNo payment gating\nKeep system simple and practical\nAvoid over-engineering (especially in UI builder)\n10. Key Risks / Considerations\nThese should be handled carefully:\nIncorrect database credentials from users\nSecurity risks from user-provided connection strings\nDomain mapping complexity\nUI customization becoming too complex\nPerformance degradation with many tenants\n11. Expected Deliverables\nFully functional Admin Dashboard\nFully functional Storefront\nMulti-tenant system\nDomain support\nUI customization system\nDeployment-ready codebase\n12. Goal\nThe system should:\nEnable non-technical users to create stores\nProvide controlled customization (not full freedom)\nStay fast, simple, and scalable\n", "outcome": "Answered", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T19:59:59.701Z"}], "industry": "", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T19:59:07.856Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T20:03:37.881Z", "assignedTo": "Sumbleen Javaid", "isRelevant": tru