-4678-95fb-2a9c7b14a438", "sku": "black-seed-oil-100ml", "name": "Black Seed Oil کلونجی کا تیل", "unit": "Pcs", "brand": "kOr", "price": "1234", "status": "Active", "category": "Organic Oil", "costPrice": "0", "createdAt": "2026-04-10T18:03:43.565Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T15:32:52.123Z", "description": "Split Mung Beans (دال مونگ) — A light, nutritious lentil that cooks quickly and is easy to digest, perfect for healthy everyday meals.", "purchasePrice": "0", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "818758ea-b082-490b-b58e-c4a66ad5a5e6", "sku": "sesame-oil-100ml", "name": "Sesame Oil  روغن تل", "unit": "Pcs", "brand": "kOr", "price": "199", "status": "Active", "category": "Organic Oil", "condition": "", "costPrice": "0", "createdAt": "2026-04-10T18:03:43.566Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T18:52:28.758Z", "description": "Argan Oil — A premium, nutrient-rich oil known for its moisturizing properties and everyday beauty and wellness use.", "purchasePrice": "0", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "dd0741ee-8a6a-4636-8852-ae06d9f6f6a3", "sku": "almond-oil-100ml", "name": "Almond Oil  روغن بادام", "unit": "Pcs", "brand": "kOr", "price": "799", "status": "Active", "category": "Organic Oil", "costPrice": "0", "createdAt": "2026-04-10T18:03:43.566Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T15:28:28.672Z", "description": "Elevate your cooking with our premium Pure Wheat Flour. Milled from the finest wheat grains, it promises a delightful aroma, rich flavor, and smooth texture in every dish. Versatile and essential in every kitchen, our flour ensures perfection in baking, frying, and cooking. Experience the difference with our quality flour, the cornerstone of delicious meals.", "purchasePrice": "0", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "241ad786-677b-495f-b979-f5657c5b65a7", "sku": "argan-oil-100ml", "name": "Argan Oil روغن آرگن", "unit": "Pcs", "brand": "kOr", "price": "1399", "status": "Active", "category": "Organic Oil", "costPrice": "0", "createdAt": "2026-04-10T18:03:43.567Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T15:29:52.262Z", "description": "Discover the superior quality of our Pure Basmati Rice (چاول). Sourced from the finest fields, our rice boasts a rich aroma, perfect texture, and delightful flavor. Ideal for a variety of dishes, from everyday meals to gourmet recipes, it ensures fluffy, separate grains every time. Elevate your cooking with our premium Pure Rice, a staple for any kitchen.", "purchasePrice": "0", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "c3bf4eaa-e236-4999-a756-3f1be20ef72b", "sku": "flax-seed-oil-100ml", "name": "FlaxSeed Oil", "unit": "Pcs", "brand": "kOr", "price": "199", "status": "Active", "category": "Organic Oil", "costPrice": "0", "createdAt": "2026-04-10T18:03:43.569Z", "localName": "(السی)", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T15:24:58.566Z", "description": "Experience the versatile goodness of our Pure Besan (بیسن). Made from the finest chickpeas, our besan is rich in protein and essential nutrients. It’s perfect for a variety of culinary uses, from traditional pakoras and chillas to savory snacks and gluten-free baking. With its fine texture and rich flavor, our pure besan ensures delicious results every time. Enhance your cooking with this nutritious and high-quality ingredient.", "purchasePrice": "0", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "6011187f-958d-44df-ad3b-08c80ecf34fa", "sku": "caster-oil-100ml", "name": "Castor Oil  روغن ارنڈی", "unit": "Pcs", "brand": "kOr", "price": "449", "status": "Active", "category": "Organic Oil", "costPrice": "0", "createdAt": "2026-04-10T18:03:43.569Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T15:34:40.038Z", "description": "Enjoy the wholesome goodness of our Pure Oatmeal (دلیہ). Made from the finest quality oats, our oatmeal is a nutritious choice for a healthy breakfast. Rich in fiber, protein, and essential nutrients, it provides sustained energy and promotes digestive health. Whether you prefer it cooked or raw, our pure oatmeal is perfect for a hearty porridge, smoothies, or baking. Start your day right with our delicious and versatile Pure Oatmeal.", "purchasePrice": "0", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "638199bd-e06f-4ac3-a75c-b94309d1d0d0", "sku": "mustard-oil-1ltr", "name": "Mustard Oil سرسوں کا تیل", "unit": "Pcs", "brand": "kOr", "price": "700", "status": "Active", "category": "Organic Oil", "costPrice": "0", "createdAt": "2026-04-10T18:03:43.570Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-17T15:37:16.019Z", "description": "Multigrain Atta ملٹی گرین آٹا is a flour made using a combination of multiple grains such as wheat, ragi, oats, maize(corn, chana dal, and soya bean etc.", "purchasePrice": "0", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "ac27f4b2-2300-49aa-8d7e-a2fb14e2efb9", "sku": "aprioct-oil-100ml", "name": "Apricot Oil خوبانی تیل", "unit": "Pcs", "brand": "kOr", "price": "349", "status": "Active", "category": "Organic Oil", "costPrice": "0", "createdAt": "2026-04-10T18:03:43.570Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-13T17:01:02.985Z", "description": "Jau (Barley''s) Ka Sattu: is a traditional Indian food made from roasted barley grains. To prepare it, barley grains are roasted until they turn brown and aromatic, then ground into a fine powder. This powder can be consumed as is or mixed with water, milk, yogurt, or other ingredients to make a nutritious drink.", "purchasePrice": "0", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "484e8014-b26a-4bdb-a5b5-88e8e10a50bf", "sku": "wheat-aata-pisai-1kg", "name": "Milling آٹا پسائی", "unit": "Kilogram (Kg)", "brand": "", "price": "15", "status": "Active", "category": "Services", "costPrice": "", "createdAt": "2026-04-13T16:53:31.330Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-13T17:07:57.460Z", "description": "", "purchasePrice": "", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "432732cf-1786-4509-809b-90654a6cab27", "sku": "grading-1kg", "name": "Grading صفائی", "unit": "Kilogram (Kg)", "brand": "", "price": "5", "status": "Active", "category": "Services", "costPrice": "", "createdAt": "2026-04-13T16:56:50.887Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-13T17:33:34.926Z", "description": "", "purchasePrice": "", "wholesalePrice": ""}, {"id": "40652e8c-1902-4fc5-ac80